 <h2>Statement of non-discrimination</h2>
 <p>CoreFlow Specialty Infusion complies with applicable federal civil rights laws and does not discriminate, exclude people, or treat them differently on the basis of race, color, national origin, age, disability, or sex (including pregnancy, sexual orientation, and gender identity). We provide reasonable accommodations for people with disabilities and language assistance for people whose primary language is not English, free of charge.</p>

 <h2>Accessible communications</h2>
 <p>CoreFlow provides free aids and services to people with disabilities and free language services to people whose primary language is not English. To request these services, call <strong>{{ site.phone }}</strong>. </p>
 <h2>Language assistance</h2>
 <p>Language assistance services, free of charge, are available to you. Call <a href="tel:{{ site.phoneTel }}"><strong>{{ site.phone }}</strong></a>.</p>
 <p lang="es"><strong>ATENCIÓN:</strong> si habla español, tiene a su disposición servicios gratuitos de asistencia lingüística. Llame al {{ site.phone }}.</p>
