 <h2>Grievance procedure</h2>
 <p>If you believe CoreFlow failed to provide these services or discriminated in another way on the basis of race, color, national origin, age, disability, or sex, you can file a grievance with our Civil Rights Coordinator, in person, by mail, by fax, or by email, using the contact information below. If you need help filing a grievance, our Civil Rights Coordinator is available to help you. You may file a grievance within sixty (60) days of the date you become aware of the alleged discrimination.</p>

